        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Third year without the Black Snake"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, I'm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatcha here for? Don't like the look of your clothes. Some old vet, are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get lost! There's nothing even left here. You lot stole it, all of it! And what you couldn't steal, you burned!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bastards! You came to kill me? Kill me, then! Goddamned demons!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, sir, I'm here to tell you that the Infected Patrol Unit is sweeping this area today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094",
        "name2": "avg_npc_078",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let 'em sweep! Let 'em kill us all, why don't you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "We built our pathetic, unlivable village all the way out here, and they still come for us! What else can we do but let 'em!?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir. You can hide yourselves, and I'll talk to them. Or I can conceal myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094"
    },
    {
        "text": "And who're you? I always said, you military noble bunch, no matter what you pretend! You're all just out for our lives\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, you're not quite their sort. You actually talk with us! And they think we're barely even worth whipping!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Hello?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gone...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of stunt is this? Oh... damn us all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn us all. What a pathetic ending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's no bad thing to know your own damnation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... Mr. Patrolman...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Destitute and lousy. Bad physique. You wouldn't be much use even if we sent you to the mines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you want to die, then? Painlessly? Slowly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mr. Patrolman! Look at me... what harm would leaving me alive do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "You say that with a weapon in your hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_094"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 0,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 20,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...Sorry, Mr. Patrolman! This was for whoever that was just a minute ago! I don't know where she's gone now, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even burdenbeasts are worth more than you Infected. They can at least move goods. Your existence is a waste of His Majesty's land!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did you come from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078"
    },
    {
        "text": "From far, far east.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell are you...? You, are you Infected too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can think. I can speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "We Infected live and die. Why should you decide when and how?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this bullshit?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you could let us die peacefully on our own terms, we'd hardly even be upset about it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, my Infected brother, look up at him! Look at his face, his grin, his laugh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "They want to decide our fates. Control us. Perhaps our lives aren't worth much, but do you think you'd be worth a single gold coin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "You!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "My brother, in all their past outrageous acts, have they ever spared someone for their conduct? Have they ever let another live for following instructions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "They have not! Each time they let you live, it was only because they still saw worth they could squeeze from you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "With no money and no land left, they'd kick you to the floor. After all, the cities don't even give Infected the chance to live!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "How should we Infected live? How should we die? That is for us to decide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_094",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... who are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_082"
    },
    {
        "text": "You good-for-nothing! Tell me your name at once!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the name of the Emperor! For daring to lead his citizenry astray with these ludicrous ideals, we sentence you to death!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_078"
    },
    {
        "text": "To my brothers, I have no name. Refer to me how you wish. If you must call me something, you may call me Talulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "To my enemies, you have no need for my name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "But my fires will set you alight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Talulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
